# Gate 2's signature, enforced by GitHub instead of by trust.
#
# CI can verify a review RECORD exists in artifacts/reviews/ - it cannot
# verify a human wrote it. The only thing that can is GitHub itself: a
# branch ruleset on main with "Require a pull request before merging" +
# "Require review from Code Owners" reads THIS file and refuses the merge
# until someone listed here clicks approve. That click is the human gate.
#
# Replace the placeholder with your handle at Phase 0. This file lives in
# .github/, which is a protected path - the agent cannot edit the list of
# humans allowed to approve its own work.
* @YOUR-GITHUB-USERNAME
